From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Micheal Waltz <micheal@ecliptik.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 15:50:48 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Build without SDL2_mixer

i_sound.c only got SDL.h and string.h through SDL_mixer.h, so
-DENABLE_SDL2_MIXER=OFF failed (SDL_GetCurrentAudioDriver, memcmp).
---
 src/i_sound.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/i_sound.c b/src/i_sound.c
index 443ce4d1..f939cc11 100644
--- a/src/i_sound.c
+++ b/src/i_sound.c
@@ -17,6 +17,9 @@
 
 #include <stdio.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
+#include <string.h>
+
+#include "SDL.h"	// psdoom-plus: also needed without SDL2_mixer
 
 #include "config.h"
 #include "doomtype.h"
